WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.100
The world is coming undone.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.500
Imperial flags reign across the galaxy.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.700
I feel very proud to be

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.440
in the business for so many years.

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:26.750
Asians have proven themselves

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:29.120
who are as good as anybody else.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.460
My character is very connected to the

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:33.980
Force and in fact his lines is always

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:36.320
surrounded by connecting with the Force

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:38.900
May the Force be with you... I am the Force.

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:40.520
I just done a lot of research you know

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:43.340
on how to play a very fun,

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:45.739
not just a very typical blind person, he's a

00:00:45.739 --> 00:00:48.170
blind warrior that lives in a Star Wars

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:50.960
universe, so I was intended to create

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:52.940
this character very unique and special.

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:54.830
In my films nowadays, no matter what

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:56.720
films that I'm in, y'know, I think

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:58.790
that influences is automatic.

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:00.680
If I'm Donnie, obviously you're gonna see a lot

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:03.320
of Donnie Yen's characteristics in

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:05.059
any role that I play, not just this role.

00:01:05.059 --> 00:01:06.560
You see that when I'm fighting, it is part of me.

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:08.570
That time I didn't really want to

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:10.820
leave my home and my children have a lot

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:12.350
to do with it because i asked them,

00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:13.850
would you like to see your father in Star Wars.

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:16.250
And of course the answer was "Yes!"

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:18.530
The past Halloween, we wanted to do

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:21.979
a Star Wars theme. It was my wife's idea and we

00:01:21.979 --> 00:01:24.259
ask Disney to help me and they

00:01:24.259 --> 00:01:26.960
were very generous and they sent me this

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:30.020
exact fabrics from my outfit, sent over

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:33.020
to Hong Kong and had my Hong Kong team to

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:35.810
create the exact outfit for the past

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:37.670
Halloween and then I posted it up on Instagram.

00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:39.530
And my daughter was the Stormtrooper.

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:41.390
I don't believe it was created

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:43.190
especially for me, they were looking for

00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:45.679
character like that and i believe that

00:01:45.679 --> 00:01:47.000
was the reason why they called me.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:54.150
Well, I think Chirrut, if you give him a

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:56.310
lightsaber, he could take on Darth Vader.

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:59.700
But the producer didn't give me the lightsaber.

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:02.310
I think that stormtroopers, you know for me,

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:04.810
if you could fight 10, you could fight 20... in that world.

